[1.0.0]
* Initial release of Windmill for Cloudron.
* Windmill Community Edition 1.741.0, official binary used unmodified.
* Single container: Windmill standalone (server + worker) + bundled PostgreSQL 16 + nginx, under supervisor.
* All state under /app/data (PostgreSQL data, dependency caches), captured by Cloudron backups.
* Outgoing email wired to the Cloudron sendmail addon.
* Languages out of the box: Python (uv), TypeScript (Deno/Bun), Go, Bash, SQL.
* App-native authentication; optionalSso.
